// Ch12 B01 "The Cold Road" (C, 1 min). act2_ch12.md §2 B01. K01: the road's laid-stone zigzag climbing scree
// under grey crags; a pass-cord across the saddle hung with keth in undyed wool and red, moving in the wind
// against an enormous sky (the red the only warm note). P01: the party small on the first switchback. The
// few motes up here RISE FAST, straight up and gone (rule 2: up here the dead lift quickly).
title: ch12_cold_road
location: ch12/keth_pass
---
@letterbox on
@camera K01
@music keth_pass fade=2.0
@wait 5.0
@camera P01
@vfx glimmer_lift at=pass_motes count=4 motion=spiral_up rate=fast
@wait 2.0
Pell [neutral]: Quick. Up here. #line:ch12_road_001 #tn:"The dead lift quickly in the mountains."
@wait 1.5
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
